WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
Today is the day before your procedure and this is the most important day of

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.600
your prep, so let's make it count.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.440
Starting today, you must drink clear liquids only, which includes water, broth,

4
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.000
plain tea, black coffee, clear juices, and plain gelatin.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.840
Stay well hydrated throughout the day, and remember, no solid foods, no alcohol

6
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.000
, and no dairy.

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.230
Avoid anything red, purple, blue, or orange, as these dyes can be mistaken for

8
00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.000
blood during the procedure.

9
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Begin your bowel prep exactly when your prep instruction sheet says to.

10
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Don't skip ahead or delay.

11
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.940
If you're on a split-dose schedule, your second dose will be taken the morning

12
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.000
of your procedure.

13
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Your instruction sheet will have the exact timing for that.

14
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.770
One important note about your ride tomorrow, rideshares and taxis are fine for

15
00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.000
getting you to your procedure.

16
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.950
But after your procedure, you may only use a rideshare or taxi if a companion

17
00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:55.000
who is 18 or older is in the car with you.

18
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Going home alone in a rideshare or taxi is not permitted.

19
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Please make sure you have that arranged in advance.

20
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.000
You're almost there.

21
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Stick with it.
